OL,3,GNEWSADismay as veterans' handmade war
OL,4,Amemorial stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeterans who handmade memorials to
OL,7,Ffallen soldiers were dismayed to find
OL,8,Fthey had been stolen.
OL,10,FThey discovered that four of the wooden
OL,11,Fsilhouettes had been taken from the
OL,12,Fdisplay near Leigh Sports Village in in
OL,13,FGreater Manchester was made earlier by
OL,14,Fmembers of a group set up to support
OL,15,Fex-service people.
OL,17,FGeorge Brooks, who launched The Reeva
OL,18,FProgramme, said: "We are absolutely
OL,19,Fgutted.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
